          {
            "title": "Complete the Workflow",
            "id": 152202,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un'app meteo recupera le previsioni, controlla la presenza di un errore HTTP e poi legge i dati JSON. Quale sequenza è corretta?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>requests.get()</code>, poi <code>raise_for_status()</code>, poi <code>response.json()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima <code>response.json()</code>, poi <code>requests.get()</code>, quindi <code>raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.post()</code>, poi <code>response.json()</code>, quindi <code>raise_for_status()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>requests.get()</code>, poi <code>raise_for_status()</code>, poi <code>response.json()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un'app meteo recupera le previsioni, controlla la presenza di un errore HTTP e poi legge i dati JSON. Quale sequenza è corretta?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>requests.get()</code>, poi <code>raise_for_status()</code>, poi <code>response.json()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima <code>response.json()</code>, poi <code>requests.get()</code>, quindi <code>raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.post()</code>, poi <code>response.json()</code>, quindi <code>raise_for_status()</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>requests.get()</code>, poi <code>response.json()</code>, poi <code>raise_for_status()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>requests.get()</code>, poi <code>raise_for_status()</code>, poi <code>response.json()</code>.</p></body></html>",
